The full MIT License text ships with the submodule at
src/main/native/whisper/LICENSE.

This project also compiles src/main/native/whisper/examples/grammar-parser.cpp
from the same whisper.cpp source tree into the whisper-jni native library.

================================================================================
3. Bundled VAD model
================================================================================

The published jar includes a Voice Activity Detection model,
ggml-silero-v6.2.0.bin, obtained from:

  https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/whisper-vad

It is a ggml conversion of the Silero VAD model
(https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad). Verify its license terms before
redistributing this jar outside your own organisation.
